NowRepeater is an application specially designed for foreign language learners. Its convenient and practical functions and simple and beautiful UI interface make you get twice the result with half the effort when practicing listening and speaking.

【 Main functions 】
1. Variable speed playback. Audio files can be freely set playing speed, fast or slow, convenient to hear the details of pronunciation;
2. AB break point repeat. The AB breakpoint can be set freely, and the number of times of repeated playback at the breakpoint can be set freely. The key content can be listened to repeatedly and broken each.
3. Read-after function. You can intercept part of the speech content to read and imitate, waveform can clearly see the rhythm and pause of pronunciation, so that you have a target in oral practice;
4. Repeat by lyrics. Click a single lyric to repeat the part of the content, save the trouble of dragging back and forth, convenient and practical;
5. Record. Simple and efficient recorder, with listening function, recording completed recording can be opened with repeat mode and can export MP3 format recording file, class listening, important meetings in the work, voice record all done;
6. Convenient and fast way to import files. Support WeChat, QQ, Baidu network disk and many other third-party application file import, provide local WiFi import function, support AirDrop airdrop;
7. Support LRC lyrics import function;
8. Automatic matching of pop song lyrics. When you import is a popular song, you can match the corresponding lyrics online, singing learning songs easily done;
9. Automatic repeating function. Can specify repeat parameters, repeat according to the order of lyrics, super practical!
10. AB breakpoint automatic repeat function. The AB breakpoints can be read in the order of the set repeat parameters, super practical!
11. Automatic breakpoint and automatic repeat function. The automatic breakpoint is automatically reread according to the number of rereads and the interval of time.
